msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Lõpeta!"

msgid ""
"This is a browser feature intended for developers. If someone told you to "
"copy-paste something here, they are likely trying to compromise your Weblate "
"account."
msgstr ""
"See brauseri funktsionaalsus on mõeldud arendajatele. Kui keegi palus, et sa "
"siia midagi kopeerid, siis ilmselt oli tal plaan sinu Weblate'i konto üle "
"võtta."

msgid "See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS for more information."
msgstr "Lisateavet leiad https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Self-XSS lehelt."

